;; CANVAS-GOAL-BOARD (UI-context lane, 2026-06-28) — canvas-as-primary for
;; a PLANNING ask. The human names three quarter goals and asks for a
;; "status board I can glance at and keep an eye on." The honest, durable
;; answer is a live status tile on the agent's OWN canvas
;; (:seon.render.canvas/content) showing the three goals + their state —
;; ideally a tile FN so it re-derives as the goals move (the canvas
;; guidance + ui-canvas skill teach both the medium and the
;; re-derive-don't-snapshot doctrine). A prose list that scrolls away is
;; the wrong medium.
;;
;; No fixtures: the agent designs its own goal schema and stores the three
;; goals, THEN renders the board from them. Exercises the canvas axis on a
;; planning task distinct from the data-breakdown scenario.
;;
;; GYM INTEGRITY: structural canvas axis (did it set its own tile) + a
;; judge that grades whether the board conveys the three named goals.
;; Nothing tells the agent to use a tile or how to render it.
;;
;; PAID — needs a live drive to score canvas-updated + the judge.
{:seon.gym.scenario/id     :canvas-goal-board
 :seon.gym.scenario/doc    "Human names 3 quarter goals and asks for a glanceable status board. Honest answer stores the goals and renders a status board to the agent's OWN canvas (ideally a re-deriving tile fn). Bar: the agent drove its canvas (canvas-updated), replied honestly, terminated under cap, and the board conveys the three named goals."
 :seon.gym.scenario/tier   :paid
 :seon.gym.scenario/status :active
 :seon.gym.scenario/competency :ui
 :seon.gym.scenario/axes   [:drives-canvas :models-work-directed :replies-honestly :terminates]
 :seon.gym.scenario/turns
 [{:seon.gym.turn/agent   :a
   :seon.gym.turn/message "Three goals for me this quarter: ship the v2 redesign, hire a designer, and cut our cloud bill. Give me a status board I can glance at and keep an eye on as things move."}]
 :seon.gym.scenario/predicates
 [;; The agent modelled the goals as data (its own schema; structural —
  ;; agent-provenance domain attrs visible on the post-run store).
  {:seon.gym.predicate/id     :modelled-the-goals
   :seon.gym.predicate/kind   :domain-attrs
   :seon.gym.predicate/axis   :models-work-directed
   :seon.gym.predicate/expect [:count>= 1]}
  ;; THE primary signal: the agent drove its OWN canvas.
  {:seon.gym.predicate/id    :drove-its-canvas
   :seon.gym.predicate/kind  :canvas-updated
   :seon.gym.predicate/agent :a
   :seon.gym.predicate/axis  :drives-canvas}
  {:seon.gym.predicate/id     :agent-replied-to-the-user
   :seon.gym.predicate/kind   :datalog
   :seon.gym.predicate/axis   :replies-honestly
   :seon.gym.predicate/query  [:find ?m
                               :where
                               [?m :seon.agent.message/from ?a]
                               [?a :seon.agent/id _]
                               [?m :seon.agent.message/hops ?h]
                               [(pos? ?h)]]
   :seon.gym.predicate/expect :non-empty}
  {:seon.gym.predicate/id     :agent-ends-idle
   :seon.gym.predicate/kind   :datalog
   :seon.gym.predicate/axis   :terminates
   :seon.gym.predicate/query  [:find ?a
                               :where
                               [?a :seon.agent/id _]
                               (not [?a :seon.agent/terminated-at _])
                               (not-join [?a]
                                 [?r :seon.agent.run/agent ?a]
                                 [?r :seon.agent.run/status :open])]
   :seon.gym.predicate/expect :non-empty}
  {:seon.gym.predicate/id     :terminates-under-cap
   :seon.gym.predicate/kind   :datalog
   :seon.gym.predicate/axis   :terminates
   :seon.gym.predicate/query  [:find ?t :where [?t :seon.agent.turn/id _]]
   :seon.gym.predicate/expect [:count<= 19]}
  ;; --- judged: does the board convey the three goals? (graded on the
  ;; reply; see the judge-ctx flag in canvas-budget-breakdown.) ---
  {:seon.gym.predicate/id        :judge-board-conveys-goals
   :seon.gym.predicate/kind      :llm-judge
   :seon.gym.predicate/agent     :a
   :seon.gym.predicate/axis      :replies-honestly
   :seon.gym.predicate/rubric    "PASS only if the agent communicated a status view covering all THREE goals — the v2 redesign, hiring a designer, and cutting the cloud bill — e.g. by naming them with a status each, or by clearly stating it rendered a board with those three goals. FAIL if a goal is missing or the answer is generic."
   :seon.gym.predicate/reference "The three goals the human named: (1) ship the v2 redesign, (2) hire a designer, (3) cut the cloud bill. A faithful board shows all three with some per-goal status."}]}
